15
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:32,560
Entonces, este es el coaxial,

16
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,520
que está soldado acá — sí, así que

17
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,600
básicamente la placa

18
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,000
