101
00:03:25,400 --> 00:03:28,200
Obviamente algo está realimentando.

102
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:30,360
Bueno, lo que sea.

103
00:03:30,360 --> 00:03:31,840
Ese es el

104
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:34,400
aparatejo — ahí vamos.

105
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,120
500 vatios

106
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,640
funcionando.

107
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:39,200
Pero tengo que apagarlo,

108
00:03:39,200 --> 00:03:40,600
porque ese transistor

109
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:42,600
